abstract: >-
  An exploratory four-coordinate catalogue and hexadecimal indexed-GIF
  transport model, with a 256 by 256 pixel working profile, 64 by 64 effective
  modules, up to 64 entries and up to 64 frames. English is the default
  language; Portuguese is the alternative. A reproducible 16-state study
  recovers 48 KiB exactly. A bilingual app demonstrates selected-module
  color copying and reception, with recorded GIF and WebM walkthroughs.
